            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/432915?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">The <code class=\"notranslate\">nonce</code> property of <a href=\"https://w3c-fedid.github.io/FedCM/#dictdef-identityproviderrequestoptions\" rel=\"nofollow\">IdentityProviderRequestOptions</a> has been deprecated and removed from the spec:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://w3c-fedid.github.io/FedCM/#dictdef-identityproviderrequestoptions\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c-fedid.github.io/FedCM/#dictdef-identityproviderrequestoptions</a><br>\n<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2518008808\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c-fedid/custom-requests/issues/3\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c-fedid/custom-requests/issues/3/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c-fedid/custom-requests/issues/3\">w3c-fedid/custom-requests#3</a><br>\n<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3283416319\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c-fedid/FedCM/issues/768\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c-fedid/FedCM/pull/768/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c-fedid/FedCM/pull/768\">w3c-fedid/FedCM#768</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">It didn't already exist as a subfeature so I added it. I guessed about browser version: I set it to the first version to support identity credentials at all, based on:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>It didn't already have a subfeature, so I assume it was already supported when <code class=\"notranslate\">IdentityProviderRequestOptions</code> was initially supported.</li>\n<li>You can't really do identity credentials at all without some version of <code class=\"notranslate\">IdentityProviderRequestOptions</code> (not necessarily <code class=\"notranslate\">nonce</code>, but definitely <code class=\"notranslate\">clientId</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">configURL</code>).</li>\n</ul>",
