        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10931297?u=600cfcb4c4e709dfbc66b328147d846ee87b1e51&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">These were added by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/caugner/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/caugner\">@caugner</a> in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3020485719\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/26624\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/26624/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/26624\">#26624</a> but testing shows Chrome does support this.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Go to: <a href=\"https://codepen.io/web-dot-dev/pen/emZRyaZ\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://codepen.io/web-dot-dev/pen/emZRyaZ</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Put in an invalid value and not the copepen tells you this:</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/526206092-710c076e-211c-4036-a085-ff5aa5164c8f.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..QZxLsGrbTMyiQabIoNCdBi5MAj3oKSA7pII2ymPSi30\"><img width=\"963\" height=\"479\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/526206092-710c076e-211c-4036-a085-ff5aa5164c8f.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..QZxLsGrbTMyiQabIoNCdBi5MAj3oKSA7pII2ymPSi30\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 479px;\"></a>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Put in a supported value and not message, showing this is supported:</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/526206141-1d3d3f32-864c-4962-a7d3-e95df786be26.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..UKtjfjoAe2metzBh2uh-Jhdd0odp1WlOHri07-ZCcMQ\"><img width=\"804\" height=\"396\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/526206141-1d3d3f32-864c-4962-a7d3-e95df786be26.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..UKtjfjoAe2metzBh2uh-Jhdd0odp1WlOHri07-ZCcMQ\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 396px;\"></a>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Note for <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;ident&gt;</code> you should just use any custom value (e.g. <code class=\"notranslate\">--test</code>) to show it is supported.</p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n",
